  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "### OR Logic\r\n\r\n1. Before checking the boxes, predict when the result will say \"Payment accepted.\"\r\n2. Then, toggle both checkboxes to test every combination. Notice which combination(s) make the result turn green.\r\n3. In your Activity Guide, complete all 4 rows of the OR (`||`) truth table and write one sentence explaining what you observed about how the OR operator works.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "preview",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "outline",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
